<title>THAILAND: PTTEP to issue bonds despite downgrade.</title>
<headline>PTTEP to issue bonds despite downgrade.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai bluechip, PTT Exploration and Production Plc, will go ahead with plans to issue $200 million in unsecured debentures in foreign markets despite a credit rating downgrade by Moody's Investors Service, its president Prajya Phinyawat told Reuters on Wednesday.</p>
